Erm, no. There's only one _high_ priest in each temple, and that's the
one who tends the altar[1]. There's quite often another (regular? low?
sober?) priest or two in Astral Plane temples, because the place is so
full of them. But these priests are just random altar party members. 

On Astral, you're pretty much required to step up to the altar, either
to ':' examine your location, or to #chat with the High Priest (gives
a clue when done while not carrying gold in open inventory).

[1] unless you're playing a weirdly patched version.

